==Trivia==
*Ghostlight Gardens' Japanese name, White Light Night (ホワイト・ライト・ナイト ''Howaito Raito Naito''), may be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:The Twilight Zone (1959 TV series)|The Twilight Zone]]'', as all other [[Suburbs of the Dead]] stages' Japanese names are references to different horror works.

